hi, t\u00ean t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u, chu\u1ed7i s\u1ed1 hay \u0111\u00e1nh s\u1ed1 l\u1ea1i t\u1eeb 1. Kh\u00f4ng th\u00eam gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng JSON, ho\u1eb7c kh\u1ed1i m\u00e3."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"domain_description\": \"This dataset contains information related to university admissions, including tuition fees, admission methods, application requirements, deadlines, scholarship details, and relevant source URLs for a specific university (\u0110H Khoa h\u1ecdc t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, \u0110HQG-HCM) for the 2026 academic year.\", \"question\": \"HCMUS c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\u00e9t tuy\u1ec3n n\u00e0o?\", \"resolved_question\": \"HCMUS c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c x\u00e9t tuy\u1ec3n n\u00e0o?\", \"normalized_question\": \"hcmus co nhung phuong thuc xet tuyen nao?\", \"candidates\": [{\"index\": 0, \"title\": \"Tuy\u1ec3n sinh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1a\", \"normalized_title\": \"tuyen sinh phuong thuc 1a\", \"content\": \"Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: Tuy\u1ec3n sinh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1a\\nN\u1ed9i dung: Tuy\u1ec3n th\u1eb3ng v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a B\u1ed9 GD\u0110T.\\nN\u0103m \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng: 2026\\nNgu\u1ed3n: https://tuyensinh.hcmus.edu.vn/2026-thong-tin-tuyen-sinh/\\nTr\u01b0\u1eddng: \u0110H Khoa h\u1ecdc t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, \u0110HQG-HCM\\nNg\u00e0y ki\u1ec3m tra ngu\u1ed3n: 2026-10-15\"}, {\"index\": 1, \"title\": \"Tuy\u1ec3n sinh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1b\", \"normalized_title\": \"tuyen sinh phuong thuc 1b\", \"content\": \"Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: Tuy\u1ec3n sinh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1b\\nN\u1ed9i dung: D\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i t\u1ed1t nghi\u1ec7p THPT n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i; x\u00e9t h\u1ecdc t\u1eadp THPT.\\nN\u0103m \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng: 2026\\nNgu\u1ed3n: https://tuyensinh.hcmus.edu.vn/2026-thong-tin-tuyen-sinh/\\nTr\u01b0\u1eddng: \u0110H Khoa h\u1ecdc t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, \u0110HQG-HCM\\nNg\u00e0y ki\u1ec3m tra ngu\u1ed3n: 2026-10-15\"}, {\"index\": 2, \"title\": \"Tuy\u1ec3n sinh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 2\", \"normalized_title\": \"tuyen sinh phuong thuc 2\", \"content\": \"Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: Tuy\u1ec3n sinh ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 2\\nN\u1ed9i dung: K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p \u0111i\u1ec3m thi THPT ho\u1eb7c \u0110GNL \u0110HQG-HCM v\u1edbi h\u1ecdc b\u1ea1 l\u1edbp 10\u201312.\\nN\u0103m \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng: 2026\\nNgu\u1ed3n: https://tuyensinh.hcmus.edu.vn/2026-thong-tin-tuyen-sinh/\\nTr\u01b0\u1eddng: \u0110H Khoa h\u1ecdc t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, \u0110HQG-HCM\\nNg\u00e0y ki\u1ec3m tra ngu\u1ed3n: 2026-10-15\"}, {\"index\": 3, \"title\": \"H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 x\u00e9t tuy\u1ec3n ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1b\", \"normalized_title\": \"ho so xet tuyen nguoi nuoc ngoai phuong thuc 1b\", \"content\": \"Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 x\u00e9t tuy\u1ec3n ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1b\\nN\u1ed9i dung: \u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn.\\nH\u1ed3 s\u01a1: H\u1ecdc b\u1ea1 6 h\u1ecdc k\u1ef3 v\u00e0 b\u1eb1ng THPT n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i d\u1ecbch Vi\u1ec7t/Anh; ch\u1ee9ng c\u2026\\nK\u00eanh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n: https://tuyensinhdh.hcmus.edu.vn\\nN\u0103m \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng: 2026\\nNgu\u1ed3n: https://tuyensinh.hcmus.edu.vn/2026-thong-bao-ve-phuong-thuc-x\u2026\\nTr\u01b0\u1eddng: \u0110H Khoa h\u1ecdc t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, \u0110HQG-HCM\\nNg\u00e0y ki\u1ec3m tra ngu\u1ed3n: 2026-10-15\"}, {\"index\": 4, \"title\": \"\u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 GPA ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1b\", \"normalized_title\": \"dieu kien tieng viet va gpa phuong thuc 1b\", \"content\": \"Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1: \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 GPA ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c 1b\\nN\u1ed9i dung: GPA ba n\u0103m THPT t\u1eeb 75% m\u1ee9c t\u1ed1i \u0111a. Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t B2 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ecdc b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t;